Z||000000||Rare87GT||12-20-2001||05:17 AM||||I have a 12" xtant (mtx) subwoofer and was wondering if mounting a 12" sub behind the passenger seat would fit and work good and sound good of course for the people that have done it. I know the passenger seat would be<BR>moved up slightly but not enough to take away leg room. I did have the sub mounted on the passenger floor and it took up quite a bit of room and was kind of uncomfortable for people to ride in. Give me some advice and pictures<BR>as far as mounting it behind the seat and what it looks like and diffuculty. Also where to put the amp as well. Thanks guys.<P>------------------<BR>1987 GT (Maroon)*5 Speed*<BR>(Canadian Car)<BR>2.8L Mods--No Cat, K&N||||reg||1
Z||000001||Fie Ro||12-20-2001||06:28 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://homepage.mac.com/rewq/images/87/87int/subpanel.jpg"> <P>This is my setup. The sub is an 8" Boston Acoustics. Thats smaller than a 12" but it is made specially for small enclosures. I have a JVC digifine composet up front. It's a punchy and clear installation. I can beat $$$ systems with the clarity of this installation!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Since I have my open-exhaust I always have to choose between the 2 soundsystems.......exhaust wins mostly  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
Z||000002||kneebarx||12-20-2001||10:53 AM||||hey man!  HOw did you make that console for the sub???  that look hot!  ||||reg||1
Z||000003||The Fieromaster||12-20-2001||11:48 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/James_Boom_Boom_1.JPG"> <BR>This is where Fieromaster88 (James) had his sub... I now have the sub and box although its not in my Fiero... Currently i believe James is working on installing a 6" JL sub under his dash!  Im NOT sure so dont quote me... ask him!  Oh yea... his amp was mounted in the trunk... no distortion or power loss problems from being wired so far from sub either!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">        <FONT COLOR="red"><B>"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT></B>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/thefieromastersig.gif">    <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AOL IM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="green">1992 Mitsubishi Eclipse GS ~ soon will be turboed</FONT><BR></B>||||reg||1
